<ContentType Key="22c97d11-8beb-4ce4-b858-cd93c1fc2509" Alias="eService" Level="2">
  <Info>
    <Name>E-service</Name>
    <Icon>icon-globe</Icon>
    <Thumbnail>folder.png</Thumbnail>
    <Description>One online service (Sehhaty, Etimad, staff systems…): what it is, who it is for, and a Start button to the external system. Add the steps as sections below.</Description>
